# Session history, transcripts, permissions, and other runtime data. The
# skills/ subdirectory is the exception: project skills are meant to be shared
# in-repo, so they are tracked while everything else under .runcode stays local.
/.runcode/*
!/.runcode/skills/

# Runtime data
*.db
*.db-journal

